This code will open the I2C device, set the slave address to the SHT40's address, open the log file, and then enter a loop where it sends the high-repeatability measurement command to the sensor, waits, reads the response, validates the CRC, and if everything is okay, it logs the timestamped temperature and humidity reading to the file. If there is an error with the I2C operations or the CRC validation, it will log the error and continue with the next iteration. When a SIGINT is received, it will close the I2C file descriptor and the log file.

