This code initializes the pigpio library, sets the PWM frequency and range for each of the servo control GPIO pins, sets the PWM value to start the servos, waits for three seconds, stops the PWM, and finally terminates the pigpio library. It checks the return value of every system call and releases all resources before exiting.

